            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bouncebin 1.0.9</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Choose a folder</b> in Settings opens the ordinary folder chooser,
      instead of expecting you to type a path correctly.</li>
  <li><b>New in Bouncebin</b> in the sidebar: see only what the last scan
      brought in, or everything from the past week. Useful straight after
      adding a folder you had forgotten about.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
